{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/2026-07-14-researching-a-tokyo-gas-group-internship-a2/audio/main-a97685fc9f4b.mp3","durationSec":219.648,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.96,"text":"When one company owns another company, we use two words."},{"start":3.52,"end":5.02,"text":"The big one is the parent company."},{"start":5.5,"end":7,"text":"The smaller one is a subsidiary."},{"start":7.84,"end":12.5,"text":"In Japanese, people say oyagaisha for the parent and kogaisha for the subsidiary."},{"start":13.32,"end":15.64,"text":"A subsidiary is not just a branch office."},{"start":16,"end":20.58,"text":"It is a real company with its own name, its own offices, and its own staff."},{"start":21.52,"end":26.32,"text":"The parent company owns shares of the subsidiary, so it has power over big decisions."},{"start":26.9,"end":30.12,"text":"But the daily work happens inside the subsidiary."},{"start":31.44,"end":36.54,"text":"Japanese business people also use the word 'group company' or gurūpu-gaisha."},{"start":36.54,"end":39.26,"text":"This means a company in the same family of businesses."},{"start":40.22,"end":43.8,"text":"So when your son gets an offer from Tokyo Gas Yamanashi, this is important."},{"start":44.3,"end":46.14,"text":"It is a group company of Tokyo Gas."},{"start":46.4,"end":49.46,"text":"It is not the same office as Tokyo Gas in the capital."},{"start":49.98,"end":52.38,"text":"It has its own team in Yamanashi Prefecture."},{"start":53.1,"end":53.82,"text":"Tokyo Gas Co.,"},{"start":53.82,"end":54.12,"text":"Ltd."},{"start":54.12,"end":55.2,"text":"is the main company."},{"start":55.2,"end":59.44,"text":"It was founded in 1885, more than 130 years ago."},{"start":60,"end":62.44,"text":"It is one of the largest city gas companies in Japan."},{"start":63.12,"end":69.6,"text":"It serves the Tokyo area, including Tokyo, Kanagawa, Chiba, Saitama, and some other places nearby."},{"start":70.18,"end":73,"text":"Millions of homes and many factories use its city gas."},{"start":73.86,"end":78.1,"text":"Inside the Tokyo Gas group, there is also a company called Tokyo Gas Network."},{"start":78.62,"end":81.3,"text":"This company manages the pipelines under the streets."},{"start":82.1,"end":85.54,"text":"In Japan, the law now separates the gas pipes from the gas sales."},{"start":86.32,"end":89.86,"text":"So one company sells the gas, and another company takes care of the pipes."},{"start":90.74,"end":91.78,"text":"This is the parent group."},{"start":92.38,"end":94.54,"text":"It is very big and well known."},{"start":95.56,"end":99.18,"text":"But remember: the offer for your son is not from this main company."},{"start":99.66,"end":102.16,"text":"It is from a smaller group company in Yamanashi."},{"start":103.02,"end":107.02,"text":"Tokyo Gas Yamanashi is the regional group company for Yamanashi Prefecture."},{"start":107.46,"end":111.24,"text":"It is owned by Tokyo Gas, so Tokyo Gas is the parent company."},{"start":111.99,"end":118.36,"text":"But Tokyo Gas Yamanashi has its own office, its own workers, and its own customers in Yamanashi."},{"start":119.36,"end":120.72,"text":"It handles two kinds of gas."},{"start":121.56,"end":125.86,"text":"First, city gas: gas that comes to homes through pipes in the towns."},{"start":126.56,"end":129.72,"text":"Second, LPG, also called propane gas."},{"start":130.36,"end":136.6,"text":"LPG is sold in tanks and is common in mountain areas and small villages where there are no gas pipes."},{"start":137.64,"end":142.84,"text":"Yamanashi has many small towns and mountain areas, so both kinds of gas are needed."},{"start":143.74,"end":149.68,"text":"This company is much smaller than the main Tokyo Gas in the capital, but the work is still real and important."},{"start":150.4,"end":156.04,"text":"If your son works here as an intern, he will see gas service in a countryside area, not in a big city."},{"start":156.84,"end":159.1,"text":"Here are simple steps to research the internship."},{"start":159.96,"end":163.68,"text":"First, take the offer letter and write down the exact legal company name."},{"start":164.04,"end":170.68,"text":"It is important to copy it exactly, because 'Tokyo Gas' and 'Tokyo Gas Yamanashi' are not the same company."},{"start":171.74,"end":174.8,"text":"Second, search online for that exact company's official website."},{"start":175.36,"end":178.52,"text":"Be careful: some search results are old articles or copies."},{"start":179.16,"end":180.76,"text":"Look for the real, official site."},{"start":182.14,"end":184.24,"text":"Third, open the company overview page."},{"start":184.66,"end":187.52,"text":"In Japanese this is called kaisha gaiyō."},{"start":187.52,"end":192.64,"text":"This page shows the address, the number of workers, the year the company started, and the main business."},{"start":193.86,"end":195.72,"text":"Fourth, check who the parent company is."},{"start":195.92,"end":197.9,"text":"The overview page usually says this clearly."},{"start":198.62,"end":204.56,"text":"Fifth, read what the internship program covers: how many days, what tasks, and what the intern will learn."},{"start":205.12,"end":211.28,"text":"Also prepare questions to ask: which department will he join, what does a normal day look like, and who will be his mentor."},{"start":211.84,"end":219.18,"text":"In the end, a famous name matters less than what your son will really see, learn, and practice every day."}],"words":[{"text":"When","start":0,"end":0.22},{"text":"one","start":0.22,"end":0.5},{"text":"company","start":0.5,"end":0.8},{"text":"owns","start":0.8,"end":1.14},{"text":"another","start":1.14,"end":1.42},{"text":"company","start":1.42,"end":1.9},{"text":"we","start":2.14,"end":2.16},{"text":"use","start":2.16,"end":2.4},{"text":"two","start":2.4,"end":2.66},{"text":"words","start":2.66,"end":2.96},{"text":"The","start":3.52,"end":3.58},{"text":"big","start":3.58,"end":3.76},{"text":"one","start":3.76,"end":3